o. That\u2019s all there is to him.\n\nBut if you actually research who he is, he\u2019s a puppet of the same people that control Bush. He will not do what you want as president. He is a Trojan horse for The Bush Fags.", "author": "EnforceRuleOne", "created": 1793762055884, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Peatrie", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Cannot stress this enough: the GOP sabotaged MAGA", "last_comment_created": 1793772079418, "content": "<p>It\u2019s still very early in the election results but it wouldn\u2019t be a surprise if we lost the midterms.</p>\n<p>If that happens, it didn\u2019t happen because Trump did a bad job. Trump did an outstanding job and kept virtually all of his campaign promises.</p>\n<p>The real issue is the GOP has always had a cancer in it: Bush and DeSantis people. These faggot republicans have sabotaged Trump every step of the way ALL so they can run DeSantis in 2028 as the \u201cchange\u201d candidate and bring the party back to George Bush cuckservatism.</p>\n<p>Of course, DeSantis isn\u2019t going to advertise himself as Bush 2.0. Bush was one of the most unpopular president\u2019s ever. Instead, DeSantis is going to pander, tell MAGA exactly what it wants to here, then get into power and give everything back to the globalist Bush people.</p>\n<p>Many of you are simply too dumb to understand that politicians lie and you can\u2019t actually take them at face value. You hear DeSantis say some gay shit about banning H1B\u2019s (AFTER everyone started complaining about them) and you think he\u2019s \u201cbased.\u201d</p>\n<p>Really he\u2019s a lawyer, playing you like a chump. He sees what people wants in polls. He says that\u2019s wha